  {
   "id": "u1007",
   "en": "A rookie operator who makes up for inexperience with natural\ncheer and hard work. Her looks and manner make people think\nshe's younger, which bothers her a lot. (CV: Kimiko Koyama)",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Yuu Akimizu profile (rookie operator). Line width not measured. | review: refit: reflowed; 'tend to make' -> 'make', 'a great deal' -> 'a lot'"
  },
  {
   "id": "u1008",
   "en": "A big-sister operator whose precise orders can be gentle or\nstrict. A bit pushy at times, but she looks after others, and\nthe crew adore her as a big sister. (CV: Tomo Adachi)",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Claire Stanford profile. | review: refit: 'sometimes gentle, sometimes strict' -> 'can be gentle or strict'; reflowed"
  },
  {
   "id": "u1009",
   "en": "A prodigy operator whose talent was recognized while young.\nShe hates being treated like a child and always strives to be\nan equal. A bit foul-mouthed, but endearing. (CV: Ai Nonaka)",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Pinon Colette profile. | review: refit: reflowed; 'that's part of her charm' -> 'endearing'"
  },
  {
   "id": "u1010",
   "en": "A skilled operator who judges calmly. His harsh words get him\nmisunderstood; he's just bad at showing emotion and is warm\nat heart. Glasses are his trademark. (CV: Kiyotaka Furushima)",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Itsuki Yamashiro profile. | review: refit: reflowed; 'with calm judgment' -> 'who judges calmly'"
  },
  {
   "id": "u1011",
   "en": "An elite U.N. Forces officer, chief combat controller of the\nMacross air wing. A by-the-book stickler whom Hikaru treated\nas an \"old lady\", she gradually falls for him. (CV: Mika Doi)",
   "flags": [
    "uncertain"
   ],
   "notes": "Misa Hayase profile. Who comes to have feelings is unstated; read as Misa (topic of the profile) toward Hikaru. | review: Wrong referent: the dangling modifier made Hikaru the by-the-book stickler; the source describes Misa. | review: refit: dropped 'serving as'; 'comes to love him' -> 'falls for him'; reflowed"
  },
